    "blurb": "Queue and monitor SS&C Blue Prism bots",
    "overview": "Unlock the full potential of RPA within your Camunda processes with the SS&C Blue Prism Connector. Seamlessly add work items to Blue Prism queues and monitor their status in real-time, enriching your business process orchestration capabilities.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Extend Your Camunda Processes with Blue Prism RPA",
    "splashDescription": "Integrate the power of robotic process automation (RPA) with your Camunda processes via the Blue Prism Connector. Add work items to Blue Prism queues and get real-time updates on their status. Streamline repetitive tasks and enable end-to-end automation by combining the capabilities of Camunda and Blue Prism RPA.",
